{"id":"sl/14bup87q","index":16,"layout":{"id":"ly/ux4ruhcv","name":"DEFAULT"},"elements":[{"id":"sh/5gfq9ozu","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/ido7y903","kind":"textbox","text":"复盘挖根因、过程有跟踪、分析能闭环——管理动作都要有追踪、有结果"},{"id":"sh/jex87eho","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/wbmpwjix","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/xcfq54zi","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/ap47u907","kind":"textbox","text":"01"},{"id":"sh/vad83ehc","kind":"textbox","text":"项目复盘与异常处置"},{"id":"sh/g7qp83yh","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/h8zqh8z2","kind":"textbox","text":"【月度】针对项目交付中的重大异常事件，PMO 组织深度复盘，深挖根本原因"},{"id":"sh/belkn65g","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/qdcju1ov","kind":"textbox","text":"【根治】跟进根治方案落地，杜绝同类问题复发，结论进项目台账与案例库"},{"id":"sh/dgn2pwn6","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/cfu1wb6l","kind":"textbox","text":"【专项】严重延期项目专项复盘：打破部门壁垒、协调资源推进，重新设定清晰目标与里程碑"},{"id":"sh/zi5kr65c","kind":"textbox","text":"【通报】复盘结论与责任人在项目例会通报，纳入项目考核"},{"id":"sh/yhwjy14r","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/lkn2tgni","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/0je10bmx","kind":"textbox","text":"同类异常不复发"},{"id":"sh/fm10fm58","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/elsjmhon","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/i10nupob","kind":"textbox","text":"02"},{"id":"sh/j294nupg","kind":"textbox","text":"交付过程管理"},{"id":"sh/43i5wz61","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/54rmpk7m","kind":"textbox","text":"【周】里程碑红黄绿灯，按周向全事业部通报（26 年签字仅 50 条：一战区 18 / 二战区 32）"},{"id":"sh/adgnq58z","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/vep4japk","kind":"textbox","text":"【月】交付目标跟进表：项目×里程碑×收款×交付×异常，五联对齐"},{"id":"sh/wfi5sf65","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/h0rmlk7q","kind":"textbox","text":"【长尾】交付周期超 1.5 年项目清单 + 攻克小组；暂停项目 5 个先清零"},{"id":"sh/m9g3m583","kind":"textbox","text":"【专项】WMS 改善专项（与恩枝老师对接）；定期项目分享交流会讲透延期要害"},{"id":"sh/nap4fapo","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/p4vql8r6","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/o3mps3ql","kind":"textbox","text":"长尾项目年内清零"},{"id":"sh/32d8jy90","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/2147qt8f","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/10vqhoru","kind":"textbox","text":"03"},{"id":"sh/gzmpojq9","kind":"textbox","text":"经营分析与全员改善"},{"id":"sh/fydofy9o","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/exk7mt8j","kind":"textbox","text":"【月度】经营分析复盘各项管理指标达成情况，一切用数据说话"},{"id":"sh/twb6dory","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/sv2pkjad","kind":"textbox","text":"【责任】各部门负责人基于数据提出切实可行的改善建议，不能只报数字"},{"id":"sh/szuxknq9","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/t03ytsru","kind":"textbox","text":"【闭环】建议纳入下月跟踪表，形成\"分析—建议—执行—复盘\"管理闭环"},{"id":"sh/6dcfid83","kind":"textbox","text":"【看板】推动全员改善系统与管理动作数字化看板，各项改善有追踪、有结果"},{"id":"sh/7ylgri9o","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/g3eho7ql","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/h4nyxsrq","kind":"textbox","text":"月度闭环率 100%"},{"id":"sh/u1wfmx8f","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/f25gv290","kind":"textbox","text":"AI 台账：项目台账搭在 AI 平台上（框架与恩枝老师对齐），自动通报里程碑延期、人天目标异常；经营分析同步看人均产值、有人天投入但无进度的项目。"},{"id":"sh/w7axc3q1","kind":"textbox","text":"广东精工智能系统有限公司　|　2027年战略规划"},{"id":"sh/x8jyl8rm","kind":"textbox","text":"17"},{"id":"im/eh4bex4v","kind":"image"},{"id":"sh/e10jy1sj","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/1oritgba","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/03i10bap","kind":"textbox","text":"五、27年-部门工作重点（2）项目管理与经营"}]}
{"id":"sl/y5wne50z","index":17,"layout":{"id":"ly/ux4ruhcv","name":"DEFAULT"},"elements":[{"id":"sh/v6lo3yp8","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/w7u5cjqt","kind":"textbox","text":"请总经理当场确认三件事——散会即生效，目标即可分解到季度到人"},{"id":"sh/h8365o7e","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/mhsn698b","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/72loze9w","kind":"textbox","text":"01"},{"id":"sh/bmhk7apo","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/al83y5o3","kind":"textbox","text":"编制授权"},{"id":"sh/x8z29knu","kind":"textbox","text":"27 年编制 191 人（现有 116 + 招聘 75，本科起步）：FDE 56 人、AI 创新中心扩至 10 人、综合管理组新增 4 人（PMO×2、行政×1、总账会计×1）——Q1 即期启动招聘"},{"id":"sh/cnql0f69","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/za14bu50","kind":"textbox","text":"02"},{"id":"sh/y9832pof","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/lcjmdkn6","kind":"textbox","text":"激励政策"},{"id":"sh/kbal4z6l","kind":"textbox","text":"销售岗薪酬结构改革（底薪 30% + 绩效 20% + 提成 50%）与末位改进机制确认；考核指标从\"签单额\"改为\"签单额 + 回款 + 毛利\"三项（26 年签单超额 1.1% 而毛利低于目标 6.4pct 的教训）；AI 产品签单专项激励"},{"id":"sh/fexkzqpg","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/edo3qlob","kind":"textbox","text":"03"},{"id":"sh/4j2h0rmt","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/5kvi9wne","kind":"textbox","text":"系统与预算"},{"id":"sh/ixkzyh43","kind":"textbox","text":"经营管理AI系统 1 月前完成整体规划：预算落地、数据责任人授权、PMO 专职编制到位；同时把 AI 创新中心、数采组等新业务纳入预算科目（26 年 823 万无预算列支）"},{"id":"sh/3it07m58","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/gv2hwrmx","kind":"textbox","text":"三件事确认后：27 年目标分解到季度、到部门、到人，综合管理组按月向总经理交账。"},{"id":"sh/hwbi5cni","kind":"textbox","text":"广东精工智能系统有限公司　|　2027年战略规划"},{"id":"sh/utkzuh4r","kind":"textbox","text":"18"},{"id":"im/29sr2xs3","kind":"image"},{"id":"sh/0r618bm1","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/1sfihg3m","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/9szehsv6","kind":"textbox","text":"六、资源需求与请拍板事项"}]}
{"id":"sl/nid43ytk","index":18,"layout":{"id":"ly/ux4ruhcv","name":"DEFAULT"},"elements":[{"id":"sh/u58zux03","kind":"shape"},{"id":"im/ihsjul0j","kind":"image"},{"id":"sh/4vah07il","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/5wji9czq","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/itszyx0f","kind":"textbox","text":"2027：净利率 20%，用 AI 打赢翻身仗"},{"id":"sh/3u1072h0","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/czah4rih","kind":"textbox","text":"感谢大家聆听！　为梦想加油"},{"id":"sh/d0jidcz2","kind":"textbox","text":"数字化工厂事业部 · 综合管理组　|　2026年11月"}]}
