{"id":"sl/hwbqtkby","index":1,"layout":{"id":"ly/p83mt83u","name":"MASTER"},"elements":[{"id":"sh/9072xkry","kind":"textbox","text":"本次会议要形成5项明确决策"},{"id":"sh/ozy1ofad","kind":"textbox","text":"会议目标：把4250万元从年度数字，转化为季度计划、组别责任和项目现金流清单。"},{"id":"sh/b29kza94","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/a10jqpsj","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/x4r21kru","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/w3i1sfa9","kind":"textbox","text":"01  回款口径"},{"id":"sh/r65knqtk","kind":"textbox","text":"4250万元为2027全年挑战目标；\n其中568万元为现有项目预计转入2027年回收，属于目标内金额。"},{"id":"sh/q5wjelsz","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/ove9o7yd","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/9wnqhczy","kind":"textbox","text":"02  季度节奏"},{"id":"sh/mtwrmxg7","kind":"textbox","text":"Q1 700万、Q2 1000万、Q3 1200万、Q4 1350万；\n按季度到账，而不是按交付完成额。"},{"id":"sh/nu58f2hs","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/wjy9sry9","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/xk7qlczu","kind":"textbox","text":"03  组别责任"},{"id":"sh/ahwrqhgj","kind":"textbox","text":"一组1500万、二组1500万、AI专项组1000万交付产值；\n回款责任按项目归属认领。"},{"id":"sh/bip8jmho","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/cnupgny5","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/do3q9szq","kind":"textbox","text":"04  组织投入"},{"id":"sh/t8byxkn2","kind":"textbox","text":"现有36人，完整配置54人；\nAI专项组10人按付费项目和交付负荷分阶段到位。"},{"id":"sh/s72xofmh","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/76twva5c","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/65kfmpor","kind":"textbox","text":"05  管理节奏"},{"id":"sh/hcvy14ne","kind":"textbox","text":"建立每周回款例会、每月组经营分析、每季度目标校准；\n项目经理对到账计划负责。"},{"id":"sh/gbmxszmt","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/fadgzu58","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/u94fqp4n","kind":"textbox","text":"会议最终输出"},{"id":"sh/p0vy54na","kind":"textbox","text":"确认568万元项目名单和所属组；确认季度×组别回款初步拆分；确定AI付费试点名单、组长及资源到位条件。"},{"id":"sh/4zmxwzmp","kind":"shape"}]}
{"id":"sl/ofy9wn61","index":2,"layout":{"id":"ly/p83mt83u","name":"MASTER"},"elements":[{"id":"sh/cza94vmx","kind":"textbox","text":"先正视经营压力：人数增加50%，回款目标接近4倍"},{"id":"sh/d0jax03i","kind":"textbox","text":"2026年全年回款预计约1,100万元；2027年4250万元是挑战目标，不是按扩编自然增长就能实现的预测。"},{"id":"sh/298ryl4v","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/3ah8rqlg","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/obq90bml","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/pcjqtg36","kind":"textbox","text":"2026预计回款"},{"id":"sh/m5cra54z","kind":"textbox","text":"1,100万"},{"id":"sh/n6ls3alk","kind":"textbox","text":"36人，预计全年"},{"id":"sh/n2l4fq98","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/m1c3mlsn","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/943mhgre","kind":"textbox","text":"2027挑战回款"},{"id":"sh/83ulovat","kind":"textbox","text":"4,250万"},{"id":"sh/v6l4jq94","kind":"textbox","text":"54人完整配置"},{"id":"sh/a5c3ql8z","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/x8nml0ra","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/w7ulsvqp","kind":"textbox","text":"回款目标倍数"},{"id":"sh/ja54na9g","kind":"textbox","text":"3.86倍"},{"id":"sh/i9w3u58v","kind":"textbox","text":"较2026预计全年"},{"id":"sh/e10f2twf","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/f29gbyx0","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/03ix43e5","kind":"textbox","text":"人均回款要求"},{"id":"sh/14ryd8fq","kind":"textbox","text":"78.7万"},{"id":"sh/6d0fytg3","kind":"textbox","text":"2026约30.6万/人"},{"id":"sh/re9g7yxo","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/sfix03y9","kind":"textbox","text":"规模与效率变化"},{"id":"sh/tgry9ofu","kind":"textbox","text":"人数"},{"id":"sh/a9kfadwn","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/batgjixs","kind":"textbox","text":"36 → 54人  (+50%)"},{"id":"sh/l4fi9cza","kind":"textbox","text":"回款"},{"id":"sh/k3m1g7yp","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/z2d07mh4","kind":"textbox","text":"1,100 → 4,250万  (3.86倍)"},{"id":"sh/y14jehgj","kind":"textbox","text":"人均回款需要提升约2.57倍"},{"id":"sh/x0vi5czy","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/czmhc7id","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/byd032h8","kind":"textbox","text":"经营结论"},{"id":"sh/ax4zax0n","kind":"textbox","text":"靠扩编不能自动解决回款。必须同时做到：\n1. 已有项目按节点兑现\n2. 项目上线、验收、请款形成闭环\n3. 新签项目合同付款条件前置\n4. AI项目从免费试点转为付费合同"},{"id":"sh/hwzihwzi","kind":"textbox","text":"注意：54人为年底完整编制，并非全年平均在岗人数；若分阶段招聘，人均经营压力还会更高。"},{"id":"sh/wv61obyx","kind":"shape"}]}
{"id":"sl/jyx0ra1s","index":3,"layout":{"id":"ly/p83mt83u","name":"MASTER"},"elements":[{"id":"sh/1cj2d8b6","kind":"textbox","text":"4250万元回款必须先说清楚钱从哪里来"},{"id":"sh/0ba143al","kind":"textbox","text":"568万元为现有项目预计放到2027年收取的款项，计入4250万元，不是额外增加。"},{"id":"sh/rm1k7yt4","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/ql8jytsj","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/doj29oba","kind":"textbox","text":"2027年回款目标"},{"id":"sh/sna103ap","kind":"textbox","text":"4,250万元"},{"id":"sh/3ihk3et8","kind":"textbox","text":"="},{"id":"sh/ih8ju9sn","kind":"textbox","text":"568万元"},{"id":"sh/kbm987y5","kind":"textbox","text":"+"},{"id":"sh/5cva1cfq","kind":"textbox","text":"3,682万元"},{"id":"sh/i94r6xgz","kind":"textbox","text":"现有项目结转回款"},{"id":"sh/jadsz2xk","kind":"textbox","text":"其余项目现金来源待逐笔验证"},{"id":"sh/w72947yt","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/x8vaxsfe","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/a5kr2xg3","kind":"textbox","text":"第一部分｜568万元"},{"id":"sh/v6tsv2xo","kind":"textbox","text":"把已有项目逐笔列清楚：\n• 客户、项目、合同付款节点\n• 预计到账金额和月份\n• 是否存在验收/上线前置条件\n• 责任组、PM、客户决策人\n• 风险及下一步催收动作"},{"id":"sh/g36tgryd","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/h4fa9wfy","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/p0batw72","kind":"textbox","text":"第二部分｜3,682万元"},{"id":"sh/oz29krqh","kind":"textbox","text":"必须由项目和合同支撑：\n• 其他存量合同阶段款\n• 2027新签合同首款\n• 2027新签项目后续节点款\n• 上线、验收及尾款到账\n• 不能用销售意向替代到账计划"},{"id":"sh/3ytsrmpw","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/2xkrih8b","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/1wbapc7q","kind":"textbox","text":"现金流核验原则"},{"id":"sh/gv29g7q5","kind":"textbox","text":"每笔回款必须具备：\n合同依据 + 付款条件 + 责任人\n客户确认 + 预计到账日期\n\n没有合同或客户确认的金额，先列机会池，不计入确定性预测。"},{"id":"sh/fu9sn2p0","kind":"textbox","text":"会议要求：568万元按实际项目所属组认领；其余3,682万元逐项目补齐来源，禁止重复统计。"},{"id":"sh/et0reh8f","kind":"shape"}]}
