{"id":"sl/jetc3ut0","index":10,"layout":{"id":"ly/p83mt83u","name":"MASTER"},"elements":[{"id":"sh/xcryxg7y","kind":"textbox","text":"AI专项组：先跑通付费闭环，再扩成规模化交付"},{"id":"sh/wbih4b6d","kind":"textbox","text":"年度交付产值1,000万元；回款参考额度1,062万元。AI收入仍是挑战机会，必须以付费合同和验收标准为前提。"},{"id":"sh/n69grmpw","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/250zy18b","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/98rytw72","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/o7ih0r6h","kind":"textbox","text":"年度交付产值"},{"id":"sh/72t03qp0","kind":"textbox","text":"1,000万"},{"id":"sh/61kzalof","kind":"textbox","text":"AI场景实施与集成"},{"id":"sh/ofqtgnyt","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/9gza9sze","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/mdobedg3","kind":"textbox","text":"规划人数"},{"id":"sh/nehs7iho","kind":"textbox","text":"10人"},{"id":"sh/0b6tc3yx","kind":"textbox","text":"从0开始，分阶段组建"},{"id":"sh/1cfa58zi","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/epobatgr","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/zaxs3yhc","kind":"textbox","text":"回款参考额度"},{"id":"sh/cn6t83y1","kind":"textbox","text":"1,062万"},{"id":"sh/dofa18z6","kind":"textbox","text":"按产值权重初步测算"},{"id":"sh/tsnip0ny","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/87ehgv6d","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/7650nq5s","kind":"textbox","text":"季度回款"},{"id":"sh/65wzelo7","kind":"textbox","text":"174/250/300/338"},{"id":"sh/l43ilgn2","kind":"textbox","text":"万元"},{"id":"sh/k3uhcb6h","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/j2lgjq5w","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/y1czalob","kind":"textbox","text":"Q1｜产品与客户验证"},{"id":"sh/p07ixkn6","kind":"textbox","text":"组长和核心骨干到位；筛选2–3个明确付费场景；形成报价、合同范围、交付边界和验收标准；免费试点不计产值和回款。"},{"id":"sh/4zyhofml","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/m58fih43","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/n61wbmlo","kind":"textbox","text":"Q2｜首批付费交付"},{"id":"sh/o7axk7m9","kind":"textbox","text":"至少完成首批付费项目签约与首款回收；完成场景部署、系统集成、用户验证和验收证据；沉淀标准交付模板。"},{"id":"sh/98jedc3u","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/eh8fex47","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/z2hw72lc","kind":"textbox","text":"Q3｜复制与扩展"},{"id":"sh/03qxg7mx","kind":"textbox","text":"围绕已验证场景复制第二批客户；建立方案包、实施清单、测试用例和交付人天模型；复盘毛利和回款周期。"},{"id":"sh/14ze9c3i","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/ydcfq1kb","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/jylwj6lw","kind":"textbox","text":"Q4｜产品化与兑现"},{"id":"sh/3qhsfypc","kind":"textbox","text":"形成可复用案例和标准报价；完成年度项目验收、回款及客户复购机会；未形成订单的编制不提前补满。"},{"id":"sh/ip8bmtor","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/5sjah872","kind":"textbox","text":"AI专项组扩编闸门：有付费客户 / 有合同范围 / 有验收标准 / 有明确交付毛利，满足后再补齐岗位。"},{"id":"sh/4rato36h","kind":"shape"}]}
{"id":"sl/8f2psfyx","index":11,"layout":{"id":"ly/p83mt83u","name":"MASTER"},"elements":[{"id":"sh/1gbm9s3a","kind":"textbox","text":"共享开发中心与公司综合组：交付资源必须服务于回款节点"},{"id":"sh/0f2lgnmp","kind":"textbox","text":"开发中心不是简单接需求；按项目关键路径和回款优先级排期，PMO/测试/质量提供规则和质量治理。"},{"id":"sh/ra943il8","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/q903ad4n","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/dcbm583y","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/sb2lcnmd","kind":"textbox","text":"共享开发中心｜10 → 15人"},{"id":"sh/b6d4f2lc","kind":"textbox","text":"1. 统一接收需求，必须绑定项目与责任PM\n2. 按上线、验收、付款关键路径排优先级\n3. 双周滚动排期，任务有负责人和交付日期\n4. 缺陷和接口阻塞设升级机制\n5. 开发人天按项目归集，支持成本核算"},{"id":"sh/a543mx4r","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/wvupgz6t","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/xw3q94ne","kind":"textbox","text":"公司综合组｜PMO / 测试 / 质量"},{"id":"sh/atc7epon","kind":"textbox","text":"1. 统一项目主计划和变更管理标准\n2. 检查上线、验收、请款证据完整性\n3. 对重大延期和质量风险专项督办\n4. 支持项目复盘和交付质量评估\n5. 不替代战区对项目经营结果负责"},{"id":"sh/bulo7u58","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/orapcf6h","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/9sj65kn2","kind":"textbox","text":"项目经理｜现金流第一责任执行人"},{"id":"sh/mps7a5or","kind":"textbox","text":"1. 合同节点拆到月，到账日期明确\n2. 客户待办、验收资料、付款审批可追踪\n3. 变更先确认范围和费用\n4. 每周更新风险和预测金额\n5. 对项目范围、成本、验收、回款闭环负责"},{"id":"sh/nq1o3a5w","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/0nap8f6l","kind":"textbox","text":"开发排期优先级规则"},{"id":"sh/1oj61kn6","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/hkbm5wzu","kind":"textbox","text":"P0"},{"id":"sh/gj25cry9","kind":"textbox","text":"影响客户付款/验收/生产上线"},{"id":"sh/fit436ho","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/uh0na1g3","kind":"textbox","text":"P1"},{"id":"sh/tgrm1wzy","kind":"textbox","text":"影响阶段交付和合同节点"},{"id":"sh/sfi58ryd","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/7u94zmhs","kind":"textbox","text":"P2"},{"id":"sh/6t0n6hg7","kind":"textbox","text":"一般体验优化和非关键需求"},{"id":"sh/dcv6dgz2","kind":"textbox","text":"APS主体实施与交付由外包供应商负责，不占内部交付编制；接口协调人天按项目实际归集。"},{"id":"sh/cbm5kbyh","kind":"shape"}]}
{"id":"sl/hgzapcr6","index":12,"layout":{"id":"ly/p83mt83u","name":"MASTER"},"elements":[{"id":"sh/q50nydsj","kind":"textbox","text":"战区负责人：从“盯项目细节”转向“盯经营结果与关键客户”"},{"id":"sh/bq9orito","kind":"textbox","text":"你的核心任务是把目标拆下去、把资源配到位、把关键客户和关键问题拿下来。"},{"id":"sh/o3i5w3ad","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/p4r6p8by","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/21gnuts7","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/32ponyts","kind":"textbox","text":"现在—2026.12"},{"id":"sh/gzy5s3a1","kind":"textbox","text":"把底数锁定"},{"id":"sh/1076lobm","kind":"textbox","text":"核实568万元项目名单、所属组、客户付款条件和预计月份；把其余3682万元拆成项目来源；确认各组组长与AI核心班底。"},{"id":"sh/hcfy9k3u","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/gb6x0zm9","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/vaxg7ulo","kind":"textbox","text":"Q1｜700万"},{"id":"sh/u9ofyp43","kind":"textbox","text":"建机制、拿首款"},{"id":"sh/t8fy5k3i","kind":"textbox","text":"主持月度经营分析；每周过未来90天现金流；亲自推动前十大回款风险客户；检查各组项目现金计划是否落到PM。"},{"id":"sh/876xwfmx","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/7mdg3als","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/6l4fu547","kind":"textbox","text":"Q2｜1,000万"},{"id":"sh/lkvy103m","kind":"textbox","text":"验证AI、提升兑现"},{"id":"sh/kjmxsfm1","kind":"textbox","text":"推动首批AI付费试点；评估三个组长经营能力；对资源冲突作决定；每月核验组别产值、回款、成本和毛利。"},{"id":"sh/cnqh8fux","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/xozyhkbi","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/q18f65cr","kind":"textbox","text":"Q3｜1,200万"},{"id":"sh/bmhgfatc","kind":"textbox","text":"补缺口、调资源"},{"id":"sh/oz6x4vul","kind":"textbox","text":"做年度目标中期复盘；按实际到账与未来90天预测找缺口；对延期、验收、逾期项目组织客户高层沟通。"},{"id":"sh/p0zyd0b6","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/2xof2lcv","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/3yxgbqdg","kind":"textbox","text":"Q4｜1,350万"},{"id":"sh/8vahgzu5","kind":"textbox","text":"集中验收、收官"},{"id":"sh/9wjyp4bq","kind":"textbox","text":"亲自推动重大客户验收和付款审批；清理长期挂账项目；控制低毛利和无合同变更；形成2028年合同与人员储备。"},{"id":"sh/jqlkfyds","kind":"shape"}]}
{"id":"sl/6lsnupw7","index":13,"layout":{"id":"ly/p83mt83u","name":"MASTER"},"elements":[{"id":"sh/xc7eds76","kind":"textbox","text":"管理机制：每周盯现金、每月算经营、每季调资源"},{"id":"sh/wbydknq1","kind":"textbox","text":"战区负责人不替组长做日常项目管理；组长必须对组内交付、验收和回款结果负责。"},{"id":"sh/jepwf2pc","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/idgvmx8r","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/5grehs7i","kind":"textbox","text":"角色"},{"id":"sh/kfidonqx","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/zi5c3y98","kind":"textbox","text":"必须承担的责任"},{"id":"sh/ehwvat8n","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/c3e1gjyd","kind":"textbox","text":"管理节奏 / 输出"},{"id":"sh/x4ni9ofy","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/a1wze9g7","kind":"textbox","text":"战区负责人"},{"id":"sh/b2507exs","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/kre1k3y9","kind":"textbox","text":"目标、资源、干部、重大客户、跨组冲突"},{"id":"sh/ls7idofu","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/y5wjitgj","kind":"textbox","text":"周回款例会 / 月经营分析 / 季度复盘"},{"id":"sh/z650byxo","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/0buh8zy5","kind":"textbox","text":"交付一、二组长"},{"id":"sh/1w3i14fq","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/hsvy50re","kind":"textbox","text":"组内产值、回款、成本、延期、客户关系"},{"id":"sh/grmxwvqt","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/fqdg3q98","kind":"textbox","text":"每周组会；逐项目检查未来90天到账"},{"id":"sh/up4fal83","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/pwvy90rq","kind":"textbox","text":"AI专项组长"},{"id":"sh/4vmh0vq5","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/3udg7q9k","kind":"textbox","text":"AI付费订单、交付质量、复制性、毛利、回款"},{"id":"sh/2t4fyl8z","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/d0fydk7m","kind":"textbox","text":"双周AI项目评审；月度商业化复盘"},{"id":"sh/cz6h4fq1","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/atg3idk7","kind":"textbox","text":"项目经理"},{"id":"sh/bup4rils","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/cvylkn2d","kind":"textbox","text":"项目范围、主计划、客户待办、验收资料、收款计划"},{"id":"sh/xw7mts3y","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/yxgnmxkj","kind":"textbox","text":"每周更新项目现金流和风险清单"},{"id":"sh/jyp4fil4","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/kzy5on2p","kind":"textbox","text":"共享开发中心"},{"id":"sh/lkrmhsju","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/6l0nqxkf","kind":"textbox","text":"开发排期、关键交付、缺陷、资源人天"},{"id":"sh/7m94j210","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/fi5432t4","kind":"textbox","text":"双周迭代；P0问题及时升级"},{"id":"sh/uhw3axcj","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/h4nm5sba","kind":"textbox","text":"公司综合组"},{"id":"sh/gjelc7up","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/365472tg","kind":"textbox","text":"PMO标准、质量监督、测试和重大风险检查"},{"id":"sh/25w3excv","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/p87m9cb6","kind":"textbox","text":"按项目节点检查，不代替战区经营"},{"id":"sh/47y5g7u1","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/jal4vidw","kind":"textbox","text":"周会只看5个数：本周到账、月度目标完成、未来90天预测、逾期应收、验收/请款待办。"},{"id":"sh/i9c32dcr","kind":"shape"}]}
{"id":"sl/vaxsvy10","index":14,"layout":{"id":"ly/p83mt83u","name":"MASTER"},"elements":[{"id":"sh/547mhg3m","kind":"textbox","text":"回款预警：用领先指标管理，不等季度末才发现缺口"},{"id":"sh/k3y5ov21","kind":"textbox","text":"以下阈值为第二战区建议管理线，周六会议可结合公司制度与财务口径确认。"},{"id":"sh/76p4jqls","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/65gnqlk7","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/t87ml0ji","kind":"textbox","text":"指标"},{"id":"sh/s7y5sv2x","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/na5476l8","kind":"textbox","text":"口径"},{"id":"sh/m9c3e1kn","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/wrm9kvep","kind":"textbox","text":"绿灯"},{"id":"sh/hsvat0fa","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/upkrilwj","kind":"textbox","text":"黄灯"},{"id":"sh/vqdsrqx4","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/4vm9ovel","kind":"textbox","text":"红灯"},{"id":"sh/5wvax0f6","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/it4rm5wv","kind":"textbox","text":"季度回款达成率"},{"id":"sh/judsvqxg","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/0z29cbyh","kind":"textbox","text":"实际到账 / 季度计划"},{"id":"sh/l0bqlgf2","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/1kjyt83e","kind":"textbox","text":"≥100%"},{"id":"sh/gjax03m9","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/fi1grylo","kind":"textbox","text":"85%–99%"},{"id":"sh/ehsfyt43","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/p8jyx83q","kind":"textbox","text":"<85%"},{"id":"sh/o7ah4nm5","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/361gvilk","kind":"textbox","text":"未来90天回款覆盖"},{"id":"sh/25sf2d4z","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/dc3y1s3m","kind":"textbox","text":"已确认预计到账 / 未来90天目标"},{"id":"sh/cbuh8nmh","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/uh4v2pkj","kind":"textbox","text":"≥1.2倍"},{"id":"sh/vixcvu14","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/wj6d4z2p","kind":"textbox","text":"1.0–1.2倍"},{"id":"sh/hkfexkja","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/ilov6pkv","kind":"textbox","text":"<1.0倍"},{"id":"sh/jmxwzu1g","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/4n6d8z21","kind":"textbox","text":"逾期应收账龄"},{"id":"sh/5ofe14j6","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/6p8va9kr","kind":"textbox","text":"付款到期日已过未到账"},{"id":"sh/rqhw3e1c","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/f6dcnetg","kind":"textbox","text":"≤30天"},{"id":"sh/e54ve9cv","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/18vup4bm","kind":"textbox","text":"31–60天"},{"id":"sh/07mdgzu1","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/nadwrets","kind":"textbox","text":">60天"},{"id":"sh/294vi9c7","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/pwfetobi","kind":"textbox","text":"验收节点"},{"id":"sh/ovmdkjud","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/3etcfut8","kind":"textbox","text":"达到验收条件至客户签字"},{"id":"sh/idkv6pc3","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/87e10r6p","kind":"textbox","text":"计划内"},{"id":"sh/987itwnu","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/m5wjyhoj","kind":"textbox","text":"延迟≤30天"},{"id":"sh/n650rm54","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/03e1w76d","kind":"textbox","text":"延迟>30天"},{"id":"sh/l4nipcny","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/y1wjuho7","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/z250nm5s","kind":"textbox","text":"绿灯｜按计划推进"},{"id":"sh/4zi18b6h","kind":"textbox","text":"组长持续跟踪，资源按计划安排。"},{"id":"sh/50r21gn2","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/dgnilgf6","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/sfe1sbe1","kind":"textbox","text":"黄灯｜责任人限期纠偏"},{"id":"sh/ru50j6xg","kind":"textbox","text":"PM提交客户动作和到账修正计划；组长复核。"},{"id":"sh/qtcjq1gv","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/5s3ihwfa","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/4ru1oryp","kind":"textbox","text":"红灯｜战区级升级"},{"id":"sh/3ql0fmx4","kind":"textbox","text":"战区负责人介入客户高层、资源调整和回款专项。"},{"id":"sh/ipcjm1gj","kind":"shape"}]}
{"id":"sl/gny5sjyp","index":15,"layout":{"id":"ly/p83mt83u","name":"MASTER"},"elements":[{"id":"sh/8z2h8bq1","kind":"textbox","text":"会后30天：把会议共识变成项目级执行清单"},{"id":"sh/9kby1g7m","kind":"textbox","text":"建议从2026年11月16日启动，12月中旬形成可执行的2027现金流版本。"},{"id":"sh/ytkf2h8j","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/zutgvm94","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/kv2h4rqp","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/lwbyxwra","kind":"textbox","text":"第1周"},{"id":"sh/ip4zel83","kind":"textbox","text":"锁定568万元项目清单"},{"id":"sh/3qdg7qpo","kind":"textbox","text":"项目、客户、所属组、金额、付款条件、预计到账月、责任PM；与财务核对。"},{"id":"sh/fm1gzq5o","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/e1sf65o3","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/1ojy10ne","kind":"textbox","text":"第2周"},{"id":"sh/gnax8v6t","kind":"textbox","text":"拆解3682万元来源"},{"id":"sh/nqlg3a5k","kind":"textbox","text":"逐项目补齐存量阶段款、新签首款、新签后续节点；没有依据的机会单独列示。"},{"id":"sh/2pcfa5oz","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/ps3y5knq","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/oruhcf65","kind":"textbox","text":"第3周"},{"id":"sh/bulg7u5g","kind":"textbox","text":"落实各组季度任务"},{"id":"sh/atczepob","kind":"textbox","text":"一组、二组、AI组确认客户清单、验收/请款计划、组长与PM责任人。"},{"id":"sh/mpgj6t8j","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/7qp0zepo","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/8by18jq9","kind":"textbox","text":"第4周"},{"id":"sh/9c7i1o7u","kind":"textbox","text":"形成经营看板和资源计划"},{"id":"sh/ylwj2987","kind":"textbox","text":"确定周会模板、回款预警、AI付费试点清单及54人扩编闸门。"},{"id":"sh/zm50veps","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/kne14jqd","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/lo7ixo7y","kind":"textbox","text":"周六会议需要现场确认的事项"},{"id":"sh/ih0jedob","kind":"textbox","text":"1. 4250万元季度目标是否按700/1000/1200/1350执行？\n\n2. 568万元由哪些项目组成，分别归哪个组、哪个季度？\n\n3. 3682万元由哪些合同/项目补齐？\n\n4. AI专项组负责人、首批付费场景和扩编条件是什么？\n\n5. 组长周报、回款例会和月度经营分析何时启动？"},{"id":"sh/ji9k7ypw","kind":"shape"},{"id":"sh/tcbmdcre","kind":"textbox","text":"会议结论：每一笔回款都要有项目、有合同节点、有责任人、有客户动作、有预计到账日期。"},{"id":"sh/sb2l47at","kind":"shape"}]}
